  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0:\n- Core 2048 engine: 4x4 board, Compress-Merge-Compress movement, win/lose detection\n- ASCII renderer with per-value tile colors and spawn/shake animations\n- Undo (single-level), Restart, and auto-saved Continue for in-progress games\n- Main menu: New Game, Continue, High Scores, Settings, Quit\n- High Scores: persistent local leaderboard (top 20, top 10 shown)\n- Settings persistence: saved to %AppData%\\Game2048\\settings.json between sessions\n- Theme system: 4 built-in themes (Classic, Matrix, Retro, Neon); dynamic border styles (Double, Single, Rounded, ASCII)\n- English / Vietnamese localization",
